WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
Governance follows the system lifecycle.
Inventory the purpose and dependencies,

00:00:04.777 --> 00:00:08.560
assign an accountable owner,
and define allowed data and actions.

00:00:08.686 --> 00:00:13.480
Review evaluation evidence and open
exceptions before approving scope.

00:00:13.537 --> 00:00:17.520
Operational incidents and service changes
then feed back into that decision.

00:00:17.693 --> 00:00:22.321
Apply the institution's existing risk
processes to the actual use case.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.920
The goal is a working cycle
of evidence and accountability,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.680
not a one-time model approval.
